---
// GuideSection.astro
---

<section id="guide" class="space-y-8 pt-8 border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-3">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
      Essential Aspirant Advice
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
      Why Signatures Get Rejected in Indian Govt Portals
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      Thousands of candidates face application rejection every year due to technical signature discrepancies. Follow these crucial guidelines to ensure your submission passes automated validation on the first attempt.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Rejection Reasons Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        1
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Signing in Capital Letters (ALL CAPS)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        SSC, IBPS, and Railway RRB explicitly state that signatures in <strong>BLOCK / CAPITAL letters</strong> will be disqualified. A signature must be your customary running cursive hand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        2
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">File Size Below Minimum (e.g. &lt; 10 KB)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Portals like SSC CGL and IBPS reject files below <strong>10 KB</strong> just as strictly as files over 20 KB. SignResize uses smart precision compression that guarantees your file lands strictly between 10 KB and 20 KB.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card space-y-3 shadow-xs">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
        3
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Dark Shadow & Gray Paper Background</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Photos taken under indoor yellow lighting or casting telephone shadows are rejected by OCR scanners. Our <strong>Clean White Paper</strong> tool algorithmically whitens the paper while maintaining sharp ink density.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Visual Workflow Proof: Real-World Before vs After Processing -->
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-primary font-mono">Helpful Content Visual Proof</span>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Real-World Processing: Raw Mobile Photo vs SignResize Output
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        See how our in-browser engine eliminates rejection triggers before you submit your application.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      
      <!-- Visual Proof Card 1: Mobile Phone Yellow Paper & Shadow Cleanup -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 1: Shadow &amp; Yellow Paper
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">SSC / IBPS</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <!-- Raw Photo (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-amber-100/70 dark:bg-amber-950/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Raw Mobile Photo (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <!-- SVG Mockup of Dark/Shadowy Raw Signature -->
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14 opacity-85" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Hand / Phone Shadow Overlay -->
                  <path d="M0 0 L140 0 L90 70 L0 70 Z" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.12)" />
                  <!-- Faded / Low-contrast signature strokes -->
                  <path d="M20 45 C40 20, 60 55, 75 32 C90 12, 110 40, 130 28 C150 18, 170 50, 195 38" stroke="#4a4238" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path d="M50 48 L170 46" stroke="#4a4238" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 3.4 MB</span>
                <span>Shadow Detected • Dull Paper</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">Clean White Paper 3.0 + 140×60 Crop</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Cleaned Output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <!-- SVG Mockup of Cleaned Black Ink on Pure White Paper -->
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Crisp high contrast strokes on pure #FFFFFF -->
                  <path d="M20 45 C40 20, 60 55, 75 32 C90 12, 110 40, 130 28 C150 18, 170 50, 195 38" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  <path d="M50 48 L170 46" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 14.8 KB (10–20 KB Bound)</span>
                <span>Pure #FFFFFF • 140×60 px</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Removes indoor yellow lighting and phone shadows while preserving 100% of cursive ink stroke fidelity for automated OCR.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Proof Card 2: Dual-Boundary Floor (Preventing "Must Be at Least 20 KB") -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 2: "Size Must Be &ge; 20 KB"
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">UPSC / State PSC</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <!-- Over-compressed file (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-muted/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Generic Resizer (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14 opacity-70" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Pixelated, blurred over-compressed lines -->
                  <path d="M30 40 C50 15, 70 50, 90 30 C110 10, 130 45, 170 30" stroke="#71717a" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 7.2 KB (&lt; 20 KB Floor)</span>
                <span>Blurry Quantization</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">SignResize 20 KB Floor Guard</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Safe output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" class="w-full h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Smooth anti-aliased black stroke -->
                  <path d="M30 40 C50 15, 70 50, 90 30 C110 10, 130 45, 170 30" stroke="#09090b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 24.5 KB (20–50 KB Safe)</span>
                <span>UPSC 350×350 px Valid</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Binary-search quantization ensures file size never falls below UPSC's 20 KB floor while keeping file weight under maximum limits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Proof Card 3: Left Thumb Impression (RRB & Banking) -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
              Case 3: Thumb Impression 1:1
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold">RRB / SBI PO</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Before / After Visual Container -->
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <!-- Skewed thumb photo (Before) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-muted/40 text-center overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-red-500 text-white tracking-wide">
                Uneven Aspect (Rejected ✕)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 70" class="w-24 h-14 opacity-75" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Distorted oval fingerprint -->
                  <ellipse cx="50" cy="35" rx="36" ry="24" stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="4 2" />
                  <ellipse cx="50" cy="35" rx="24" ry="15" stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.8" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-medium flex items-center justify-between border-t border-red-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Distorted 3:2 Ratio</span>
                <span>Fuzzy Ink Smudge</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transformation Arrow -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-[11px]">1:1 Square Crop + Ridge Sharpener</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Cleaned square thumb output (After) -->
            <div class="relative p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-center shadow-xs overflow-hidden">
              <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase bg-emerald-600 text-white tracking-wide">
                SignResize Output (Approved ✓)
              </span>
              <div class="py-4 px-2 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 70 70" class="w-14 h-14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <!-- Perfect 1:1 concentric ridges -->
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="26" ry="26" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2.2" />
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="18" ry="18" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2" />
                  <ellipse cx="35" cy="35" rx="10" ry="10" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-800 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between border-t border-emerald-500/20 pt-1.5 mt-1">
                <span>Size: 18.2 KB (10–50 KB Bound)</span>
                <span>Exact 240×240 px (1:1)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border">
          <strong>Result:</strong> Locks 1:1 square crop aspect ratio at 200 DPI resolution, ensuring biometric loops and whorls remain clearly distinguishable.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Mobile Photo Guide -->
  <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/30 space-y-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        How to Capture &amp; Resize Your Signature on Mobile (4 Easy Steps)
      </h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted-foreground">Takes under 30 seconds</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 01</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Sign on Clean White Paper</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Use an unruled, plain A4 white sheet. For SSC and IBPS, use a <strong>black ink pen</strong> (gel or ballpoint) in running cursive handwriting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 02</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Photograph in Good Light</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Hold your phone directly parallel to the paper. Avoid casting direct shadows from your hand or device across the signature stroke lines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 03</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Select Exam Preset</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Upload your image to SignResize. Tap your target exam (SSC, RRB, UPSC, PAN) to auto-lock official aspect ratios and kilobyte limit bounds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border">
        <span class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">Step 04</span>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Auto-Clean &amp; Download</h4>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Toggle <strong>Clean White Paper</strong> to whiten the background to #FFFFFF, check live KB preview, and tap Download to get your portal-ready JPG.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
